This was a C# group project with one other person. I made the code to connect to a database, we did not
create the database, it was auto generated. I also made the Dragons and Penguins classes and the
BaseEntity and Animal abstract classes. I also made the controls easier to use by making it so that you
don't have to push enter after each input. I also made the code that allows you to save and delete the
data from the game into the database, as well as the code for catching if you did an invalid input.
